 "sections": [
  {
   "n": 0,
   "id": "13bfd095",
   "doc": "wp-page#13963",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 1,
     "text": "Cannabis 101"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 1,
   "id": "3c4c026",
   "doc": "wp-page#13963",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>Cannabis is a plant with unique essential oil: cannabinoids. Cannabinoids have a medicinal effect by imitating compounds our bodies naturally produce (endocannabinoids). There are over 85 cannabinoids in cannabis, but the main two that you should know about are:</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "THC"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>(DELTA-9-TETRAHYDROCANNABINOL)</p><p>THC is responsible for the psychoactive (“stoned”) effects. Commonly experienced effects include euphoria, relaxation, and “giggles”.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "CBD"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>(CANNABIDIOL)</p><p>CBD has little to no psychoactive effects and can balance or counteract the anxiety produced by THC. CBD can reduce anxiety, provide pain relief, suppress nausea, support cardiovascular health, and have anti-inflammatory properties.</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "id": "d2368c2",
   "doc": "wp-page#13963",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><strong>Did you know?</strong> <a href=\"/terpene-guide/\" data-link=\"dead\">Terpenes</a> are another oil of cannabis plant that contribute to the effect on your body. <a href=\"/terpene-guide/\" data-link=\"dead\">Most common terpenes are Pinene, Myrcene, Limonene, Caryophyllene, Linalool, Humulene</a>.</p><p>Cannabis can be classified into two categories based on its effects:</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "SATIVA"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<ul><li>Increases energy, focus, elevates mood, increases creativity.</li><li>Consumed during Daytime.</li></ul>"
    },
    {
     "t": "heading",
     "level": 2,
     "text": "INDICA"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<ul><li>Relaxes and reduces stress, pain, and anxiety, promotes sleep and reduces inflammation.</li><li>Consumed at Nighttime.</li></ul>"
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "id": "bb183cd",
   "doc": "wp-page#13963",
   "blocks": [
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p><strong>Remember:</strong> Most cannabis strains are HYBRIDS and their effect fall somewhere between the two.</p><p>All products vary in their strength of effect on body and mid. Each person is unique and may experience cannabis differently. Read the packaging label for product laboratory results and consumption suggestions. Always start with a small dose and wait until getting another one.</p>"
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "kind": "table",
     "html": "<table><thead><tr><th scope=\"col\">Type</th><th scope=\"col\">Method</th><th scope=\"col\">Start With</th><th scope=\"col\">Effects Start</th><th scope=\"col\">Effects Last</th><th scope=\"col\">Wait Until Another Dose</th><th scope=\"col\">Benefits</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Flower</td><td>Smoking</td><td>One Inhalation</td><td>1 – 15 minutes</td><td>.5 – 2 hours</td><td>15 – 20 Minutes</td><td>Easy to control</td></tr><tr><td>Edible</td><td>Ingest</td><td>5mg or less, have food before</td><td>15 – 120 minutes</td><td>3 – 8 hours</td><td>2+ hours</td><td>No inhalation, longer lasting</td></tr><tr><td>Concentrate</td><td>Smoking, vaporizing</td><td>One Inhalation</td><td>1 – 15 minutes</td><td>.5 – 2 hours</td><td>15 – 20 minutes</td><td>Stronger effect</td></tr><tr><td>Tincture</td><td>Under Tounge</td><td>5mg or less</td><td>15 – 60 minutes</td><td>1 – 4 hours</td><td>30 – 60 minutes</td><td>No inhalation, longer lasting</td></tr><tr><td>Topical</td><td>Apply to skin</td><td>1 or 2 drops</td><td>20 – 120 minutes</td><td>1 – 4 hours</td><td>20 – 40 minutes</td><td>Targeted relief, no “high” feeling</td></tr></tbody></table>",
     "dev": [
      "widescreen",
      "desktop",
      "tablet",
      "mobile_extra"
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "rich",
     "html": "<p>To choose the correct product you may consult with our Product Specialist who will recommend the best type of product and method of consumption based on your preference and desired effect.</p>"
    }
   ]
  },
